WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.650
Each output is evidence for something
specific, from the guide's requirements table.

2
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.860
The hierarchy settings, the initiatives
at the intermediate root and their

3
00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:13.338
enforcement mode support baseline
configuration and configuration settings.

4
00:00:13.338 --> 00:00:15.534
Which resources log to the workspace,

5
00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:20.351
and which subscriptions have the required
plans, support continuous monitoring.

6
00:00:20.351 --> 00:00:23.512
And the manifest shows
every call was a read,

7
00:00:23.512 --> 00:00:26.850
